        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground completely covered with polychrome silks in stem filling stitches and raised gold embroidery. A wide band of conventionalized flowering plants on a black ground, bordered along one side by a band of irregular quadrilateral forms and along the other by a band of hexagons containing single conventionalized flowering plants. Cut on three sides."@en ;
